%N A015828 Inverse of 1819th cyclotomic polynomial.
%C A015828 Periodic with period length 1819. - _Ray Chandler_, Apr 07 2017
%H A015828 Ray Chandler, <a href="/A015828/b015828.txt">Table of n, a(n) for n = 0..2000</a>
%H A015828 <a href="/index/Per#periodic">Index entries for periodic sequences</a>, period 1819.
%H A015828 <a href="/index/Rec#order_1696">Index entries for linear recurrences with constant coefficients</a>, order 1696.
%H A015828 <a href="/index/Pol#poly_cyclo_inv">Index to sequences related to inverse of cyclotomic polynomials</a>
%p A015828 with(numtheory,cyclotomic); c := n->series(1/cyclotomic(n,x),x,80);
%t A015828 Module[{x, nmax = 100}, PadRight[CoefficientList[Series[1/Cyclotomic[1819, x], {x, 0, nmax}], x], nmax + 1]] (* _Paolo Xausa_, Oct 07 2026 *)
%o A015828 (PARI) first(n)=Vec(1/polcyclo(1819)+O(x^(n+1))) \\ _Charles R Greathouse IV_, Jun 01 2026
%K A015828 sign,easy,changed
%O A015828 0,1
%A A015828 _Simon Plouffe_
